## Completed run: results and promotion scope

The run found a genuine shared geometric input, rather than an identification of
the three different response/capacity objects. The accepted A/B global hull estimates
already imply that **every selected C force hull** has circumradius
`D/2+O(sqrt(D))`, regardless of invisible source population.

| New result | Classification | Exact change |
